en throws the bundle upward with exaggerated power, striking a ridiculous heroic pose in the rice field.\nStyle: photorealistic Thai TV commercial, humorous Thai comedy, exaggerated physical performance, cinematic but intentionally over-the-top, extremely hot tropical midday sunlight, realistic wet mud and water splashes, dynamic body movement, dramatic facial expressions.\nCamera: medium-wide shot, slightly low angle, energetic handheld camera movement, subtle push-in during the struggle, then quickly pull back as the seedlings are ripped from the ground. Keep the man clearly visible throughout.\nImportant: Preserve the man's appearance and outfit from the reference image. Realistic human anatomy and natural motion, but with exaggerated comedic intensity. No cuts, no extra people, no text, no subtitles.","name":"Video Generator 8","generateAudio":false,"results":[{"url":"{{user-upload}}","text":"","timestamp":"2026-09-24T04:32:51.201Z","runIndex":0}],"activeRunIndex":0,"mediaWidth":560,"mediaHeight":752},"width":749,"height":960,"style":{"width":749,"height":960},"measured":{"width":749,"height":960},"selected":false,"dragging":false,"resizing":false},{"id":"videoGenerator-EvV7XFfXmglLB8-JYC2Zs","type":"videoGenerator","position":{"x":-1998.7513532376154,"y":4341.448478847757},"data":{"model":"seedance-2.0","status":"completed","resultVideo":"{{user-upload}}","errorMessage":null,"duration":"5","aspectRatio":"9:16","resolution":"480p","prompt":"Create a **single continuous shot** based on the reference image. Preserve the woman, buffalo, bamboo platform, Thai countryside setting, warm sunset lighting, clothing, helmet, and overall composition.\n\nThe woman is **completely relaxed and chilling beside the buffalo**. She gently strokes and pats the buffalo's head with one hand, smiling warmly and peacefully as she enjoys the moment. The buffalo stays calm and comfortable beside her.\n\nShe casually **shakes/wiggles the sole of her foot slightly** while sitting, like someone who is extremely relaxed and has absolutely nothing to worry about. The foot movement should be subtle, loose and playful — a small rhythmic shake that communicates a **“so chill, so comfortable”** attitude.\n\nHer facial expression remains naturally happy and relaxed, with a slight satisfied smile. Add subtle natural body movement: gentle breathing, relaxed shoulders, slight hand movement while petting the buffalo.\n\n**Style:** photorealistic Thai TV commercial, funny Thai comedy, warm and charming, exaggerated through performance but still realistic. The humor should come from her **ridiculously relaxed attitude**, contrasting with the hard-working rural environment.\n\n**Camera:** locked-off or very subtle slow push-in, medium-wide composition. Keep the woman and buffalo clearly visible. Natural cinematic depth of field, warm golden-hour sunlight.\n\n**Motion:** smooth and realistic, no sudden movements, no exaggerated body distortion. The buffalo remains calm throughout. **No cuts, no camera shake, no extra people, no text, no subtitles.**\n","name":"Video Generator 9","generateAudio":false,"results":[{"url":"{{user-upload}}","text":"","timestamp":"2026-09-24T04:56:16.267Z","runIndex":0},{"url":"{{user-upload}}","text":"","timestamp":"2026-09-24T05:21:14.873Z","runIndex":1},{"url":"{{user-upload}}","text":"","timestamp":"2026-09-24T05:32:20.568Z","runIndex":2},{"url":"{{user-upload}}","text":"","timestamp":"2026-09-24T05:36:52.142Z","runIndex":3},{"url":"{{user-upload}}","text":"","timestamp":"2026-09-24T06:15:51.844Z","runIndex":4}],"activeRunIndex":4,"mediaWidth":496,"mediaHeight":864},"width":683,"height":960,"style":{"width":683,"height":960},"measured":{"width":683,"height":960},"selected":false,"dragging":false,"resizing":false},{"id":"imageUpload-AzJiHo6rR7sSO-uxlvOoG","type":"imageUpload","position":{"x":-2424.1682007889676,"y":3332.4918207521946},"data":{"imageUrl":"{{user-upload}}","filename":"S7.png","uploadStatus":"completed","errorMessage":nu